# Nothing goes into the build context unless it is listed. That keeps out .env and every key,
# notes/ (drafts), runs/ and results/ (traces and outputs), .claude/, .git, virtual environments
# and caches (cache/ holds the 278 MB of tables on a dev machine; the image makes its own).
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!docker/
!src/
!assumptions/
!budgets.yaml
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.txt
!requirements-demo.txt
!ci/bicycle-Cargo.lock
!tests/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
